#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Legal Document Intelligence Platform
Single-file retrieval, reranking, clause extraction, and summarization engine
for contracts, corporate policies, and regulatory collections.

Features:
- Structure-aware legal chunking preserving document, page, and section provenance
- Metadata filtering (document type, jurisdiction, party, effective year, clause category)
- Hybrid retrieval (dense embeddings + Okapi BM25 combined via Reciprocal Rank Fusion)
- Two-stage reranking (cross-encoder, LLM pointwise scorer, or lexical-structural reranker)
- Cited question answering with strict evidence grounding and refusal on low confidence
- Clause discovery across collections and structured document summarization
- Persistent SQLite store for large document collections
- CLI interface and optional HTTP API server
"""

